<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Blog</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>My Blog</h1>
    <p>Sharing stories, ideas, and inspiration</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

<main>
    <section class="blog-post">
        <h2>My First Post</h2>
        <p class="date">May 2026</p>
        <p>Welcome to my blog! This is where I share my thoughts and stories.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-post">
        <h2>Another Story</h2>
        <p class="date">May 2026</p>
        <p>This is another interesting post. Stay tuned for more!</p>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 My Blog</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>